      "computation_change_reason": "Sub-lethal failure turns on how 'statistically significant sub-lethal effect', the growth/reproduction endpoints, and 'critical dilution' are applied; alternative interpretations could change sublethal limit exceedance determinations (A), whether additional WET monitoring or permit actions are in scope (B), and whether evidence shows a documented failure versus an unresolved no-result (C)."
