      "computation_change_reason": "Test acceptability criteria determine whether a WET test may be used for compliance purposes; different interpretations of the survival, neonate-average, and brood-production thresholds could change whether monitoring was validly completed (B) and whether available results count as established evidence or must be treated as missing/unresolved (C)."
