      "exact_span": "12 - 30",
      "affected_purpose": "A",
      "computation_change_reason": "The Pimephales promelas PMSD range similarly governs sublethal significance determinations; different readings of the endpoints of the range or how PMSD is calculated could change enforceable sublethal compliance outcomes (A)."
